+# Robot Controller
+
+Policy to play multiple motion mimic RL policies.
+
+## Policy Design
+
+The policy is designed as a transition system, with:
+
+- Nodes: `PolicyNode(name, rl_policy, reference_motion)`
+- Edges: `PolicyEdge(condition, action)`
+
+The final controller has type:
+```
+PolicyGraph(List[PolicyNode], List[PolicyEdge], start=PolicyNode)
+```
